        "forms_step_id": "KBVpddxy",
        "position": 1,
        "page_heading": "How to complete this form",
        "guidance_markdown": "## Part 1: Security questions\r\n\r\nYour answers must be the same as what you told us on your online claim. You will need the following information to hand:\r\n\r\n* claim reference number\r\n* National Insurance number\r\n\r\n## Part 2: Amendment section\r\n\r\nOnly answer a question if you need to change what you submitted in your online claim.\r\n\r\nLeave questions blank that you do not want to change.\r\n\r\nUse this section to give us the correct information for your:\r\n\r\n* name\r\n* National Insurance number\r\n* date of birth\r\n* email address\r\n* home address\r\n* mobile number\r\n\r\nProof such as a copy of your driving licence, wage slip or passport will be needed to update your name, National Insurance number and date of birth.\r\n\r\n## Start part 1",
        "answer_type": "name",
        "hint_text": "Enter the same name you wrote in your claim",
        "optional": false,
        "repeatable": false,
        "answer_settings": {
          "only_one_option": null,
          "selection_options": [],
          "none_of_the_above_question": null,
          "input_type": "first_and_last_name",
          "title_needed": false
